          {
            "title": "Question: del",
            "id": 96242,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa verrà stampato dal seguente codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"side = \" /><text value=\"&quot;salad&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"meal = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Steak&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Chips&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", side]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" meal[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(side)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"salad\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>salad</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nulla, verrà mostrato un errore</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>chips</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>salad</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dopo l'esecuzione di <code>del meal[-1]</code>, quale affermazione descrive <code>meal</code> e <code>side</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"side = \" /><text value=\"&quot;salad&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"meal = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Steak&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Chips&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", side]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" meal[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(side)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"salad\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">meal non contiene più salad, ma side memorizza ancora salad</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sia meal sia side perdono il valore salad</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">meal contiene ancora salad perché side memorizza lo stesso valore</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">meal non contiene più salad, ma side memorizza ancora salad.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: del list item",
            "id": 96244,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa <code>del</code> per eliminare l'ultimo elemento di <code>shopping</code> se la lista contiene più di 3 elementi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shopping = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;bananas&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;oranges&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;lemons&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;carrots&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;beans&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" len(shopping) &gt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shopping[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(shopping)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"104\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['bananas', 'oranges', 'lemons', 'carrots']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>del shopping[-1]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: del uses",
            "id": 96247,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>del</code> può essere usato per eliminare quale delle seguenti opzioni?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Qualsiasi riferimento a un oggetto, inclusi gli elementi all'interno delle strutture dati</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo parti di un elenco</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Solo coppie chiave:valore in un dizionario</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Qualsiasi riferimento a un oggetto, inclusi gli elementi all'interno delle strutture dati.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>del</code> può eliminare un riferimento a un oggetto, incluso un elemento all'interno di una struttura dati.</p><p>Se <code>scores</code> memorizza un elenco, quale coppia può contenere due destinazioni valide per <code>del</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">scores e scores[0]</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo scores[0], perché le variabili non possono essere eliminate</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Solo scores, perché gli elementi degli elenchi non possono essere eliminati</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere scores e scores[0].</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: del object",
            "id": 96245,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa il codice in modo che <code>cookies</code> venga eliminato se l'ultimo elemento della tupla <code>permissions</code> è <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cookies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;site_access&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;adverts&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"permissions = (\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" permissions[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] == \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cookies\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Cookies deleted&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"delete\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Cookies deleted\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>-</code>, seguito da <code>1</code> e poi <code>del</code>, <code>cookies</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Elimina <code>cookies</code> quando l'<strong>ultimo</strong> elemento della tupla <code>permissions</code> è <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cookies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;site_access&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;adverts&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"permissions = (\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" permissions[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] == \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cookies\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Cookies deleted&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"delete\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Cookies deleted\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>-</code>, seguito da <code>1</code>, <code>==</code>, <code>del</code> e infine <code>cookies</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: clean dict",
            "id": 96246,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa il codice per rimuovere <code>Jason</code> dal dizionario <code>users</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Dave&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Manager&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"),\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"         \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;CEO&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"),\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"         \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Apprentice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" users[\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"keys\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'Dave': (27, 'Manager'), 'Alexis': (33, 'CEO')}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>del</code>, seguito da <code>users</code> e infine <code>\"Jason\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rimuovi dal dizionario l'utente il cui ruolo è <code>Apprentice</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Dave&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Manager&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"),\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"         \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;CEO&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"),\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"         \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Apprentice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" users[\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"keys\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'Dave': (27, 'Manager'), 'Alexis': (33, 'CEO')}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>del</code>, seguito da <code>users</code> e infine <code>\"Jason\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: negative stepping",
            "id": 96337,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa il codice in modo che venga stampato <code>[\"H\", \"e\", \"l\", \"l\", \"o\"]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scrambled = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;X&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;y&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;o&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;e&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;l&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;5&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;l&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;a&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;e&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;f&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;H&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;z&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hello = scrambled[\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(hello)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['H', 'e', 'l', 'l', 'o']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>2</code>, seguito da <code>-</code> e infine <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inizia da <code>H</code> con un indice negativo, fermati prima dell'indice <code>2</code> e torna indietro di due per stampare <code>[\"H\", \"e\", \"l\", \"l\", \"o\"]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scrambled = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;X&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;y&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;o&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;e&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;l&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;5&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;l&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;a&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;e&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;f&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;H&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;z&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hello = scrambled[\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(hello)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['H', 'e', 'l', 'l', 'o']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>-2</code>, seguito da <code>2</code>, <code>-</code> e infine <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: start values",
            "id": 96330,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quali temperature verranno stampate?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(temperatures[\" /><text value=\"-5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":])\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[14, 16, 17, 12, 11]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tutti</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nessuno: verrà generato un errore</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tutti tranne il primo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Tutti.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale espressione restituisce solo le ultime due temperature, <code>[12, 11]</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(temperatures[\" /><text value=\"-5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":])\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[14, 16, 17, 12, 11]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>temperatures[-2:]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>temperatures[2:]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>temperatures[-2]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>temperatures[-2:]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: stop values",
            "id": 96332,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale delle seguenti affermazioni è vera riguardo al valore di <code>end</code>.</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>end</code> può essere qualsiasi numero intero, positivo o negativo</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Devi essere sempre incluso un valore <code>end</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Il valore <code>end</code> deve essere maggiore del valore <code>start</code> per evitare che venga generato un errore</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>end</code> può essere qualsiasi numero intero, positivo o negativo.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il valore <code>end</code> di una slice può essere un numero intero positivo o negativo e può anche essere omesso.</p><p>In <code>letters[1:-1]</code>, cosa fa <code>-1</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Indica l'ultima posizione come estremità esclusa</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Rende la slice non valida perché end è negativo</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Inverte automaticamente la slice</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Indica l'ultima posizione come estremità esclusa.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: start:stop:step",
            "id": 96339,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quali lettere verranno stampate dal seguente codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"alphabet = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;C&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"selection = alphabet[\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(selection)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['B']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">  solo <code>B</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non verrà stampato nulla</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>A</code> e <code>B</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">  solo <code>B</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'output qui sotto è per lo slice così com'è scritto. Che cosa conterrebbe <code>selection</code> se lo slice diventasse <code>alphabet[-2:-1:-1]</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"alphabet = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;C&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"selection = alphabet[\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(selection)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['B']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un elenco vuoto</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>['B']</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>['B', 'A']</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Un elenco vuoto.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: negative stepping",
            "id": 96340,
            "contentType": "interactive",
